      "content": "but even when i'm \"still\" it doesn't help. it's like there's no \"me\" to be still. i just feel like if i could just hit delete or exit the program, everything would finally stop being so confusing and loud. it feels like the world is just running on a loop and i'm the only error that doesn't belong in the code.",
